{"id":72792,"date":"2026-11-04T12:59:28","date_gmt":"2026-11-04T12:59:28","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=72792"},"modified":"2026-11-04T15:10:04","modified_gmt":"2026-11-04T14:10:04","slug":"alcobertas-backyard-ultra","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/alcobertas-backyard-ultra\/","title":{"rendered":"Alcobertas Backyard Ultra 2027"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Alcobertas Backyard Ultra 2027<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>Alcobertas Backyard Ultra 2027<\/strong> realiza-se no dia <strong>18 de setembro de 2027<\/strong> (s\u00e1bado), com partida da primeira volta agendada para as <strong>09:00<\/strong> na freguesia de <strong>Alcobertas<\/strong>, no concelho de <strong>Rio Maior<\/strong>, distrito de <strong>Santar\u00e9m<\/strong>. Dinamizado pela sec\u00e7\u00e3o de trail running do <strong>Alcobertas Futebol Clube<\/strong> no sop\u00e9 do Parque Natural das Serras de Aire e Candeeiros, o evento desafia os atletas no exigente formato de resist\u00eancia por elimina\u00e7\u00e3o hor\u00e1ria.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">A competi\u00e7\u00e3o desenvolve-se num circuito padr\u00e3o de <strong>6,706 km<\/strong> (4,167 milhas) com nova partida a cada 60 minutos, disponibilizando quatro escal\u00f5es de participa\u00e7\u00e3o: a prova principal <strong>Ultra<\/strong> (formato Backyard Ultra ilimitado at\u00e9 restar o \u00faltimo corredor em prova), o desafio interm\u00e9dio de <strong>6 Voltas<\/strong> (~40,2 km), a vertente de <strong>3 Voltas<\/strong> (~20,1 km) e uma <strong>Caminhada de 1 Volta<\/strong> (6,7 km). As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es e respetivos pagamentos decorrem at\u00e9 \u00e0s 23:59 de 13 de setembro de 2027, existindo ainda op\u00e7\u00e3o de almo\u00e7o conv\u00edvio. Consulta o calend\u00e1rio nacional de provas de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/trail\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Trail Running em Portugal<\/a>.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; le